abstract: >-
  Ghosthread AI is a local-first Windows 11 desktop automation engine
  that operates applications in the background without stealing cursor
  or keyboard focus. This repository contains the official
  documentation: concepts, architecture, safety model, privacy
  commitments, and legal terms.
